OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after crash between two
OL,4,Avans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 51-year-old man died after two vans
OL,7,Fcrashed on a rural A-road in
OL,8,FCambridgeshire, police have said.
OL,10,FA white Mercedes Sprinter van heading
OL,11,Feastbound on the A505 collided with a
OL,12,Fwhite Ford Transit travelling in the
OL,13,Fopposite direction, between Flints
OL,14,FCross and Royston, at about 16:10 BST
OL,15,Fon 9 September.
OL,17,FPolice said the driver of the Ford, who
OL,18,Fwas from Ipswich, died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
