OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after crash between two
OL,4,Avans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver of the Mercedes, a
OL,7,F45-year-old man of no fixed abode, was
OL,8,Ftaken to Addenbrooke's Hospital in
OL,9,FCambridge with serious injuries where
OL,10,Fhe remained in a stable condition,
OL,11,Fpolice added.
